=== Ferdek Language Lexer Test ===

Test: Hello World
-------------------
PROGRAM_START
PRINT
STRING("Cześć, tu Ferdek!")
PROGRAM_END
EOF

Test: Variable declaration
-------------------
VAR_DECL
IDENTIFIER(piwa)
VAR_INIT
INTEGER(6)
EOF

Test: Arithmetic operators
-------------------
ASSIGN_START
IDENTIFIER(x)
ASSIGN_OP
IDENTIFIER(y)
PLUS
INTEGER(5)
ASSIGN_END
EOF

Test: If-else statement
-------------------
IF
IDENTIFIER(x)
GREATER
INTEGER(0)
ELSE
END_IF
EOF

Test: Comments
-------------------
VAR_DECL
IDENTIFIER(x)
VAR_INIT
INTEGER(42)
EOF

Test: Boolean values
-------------------
TRUE
FALSE
EOF

Test: Function declaration
-------------------
FUNC_DECL
IDENTIFIER(dodaj)
FUNC_PARAMS
IDENTIFIER(a)
COMMA
IDENTIFIER(b)
FUNC_END
EOF

Test: Import with path
-------------------
IMPORT
IDENTIFIER(KLAMOTY)
SLASH
IDENTIFIER(SKRZYNKA)
EOF

